# DIBAY Call Master SSOT

Canonical: `docs/dibay-chat-call-current-normal-hard-lock.md` · `docs/dibay-call-authority-lock.md` · `docs/dibay-call-native-runtime-ssot.md` · presentation docs under `docs/dibay-*-call-presentation*`.

