## A — Native / CallKit / PushKit / RTC

Outgoing/incoming media establishment is **Native Runtime** only (not Web CallV4Screen / JS Agora join). Web may POST session / handoff; Web establishment markers must be 0. Detail: `docs/dibay-call-native-runtime-ssot.md`.

Owner 승인 없이 Android/iOS Native Call lifecycle 수정 금지.  
금지 예: refactor · cleanup · Voice/Video 통합 · Native→Web ownership 이동 · CallKit/PushKit/RTC lifecycle 변경 without Owner gate.

## B — Server session

Sole writer: `updateCommunityMessengerCallSession`.  
Owns: status / answered_at / connected_at / ended_at / ended_reason / answered_device_id.  
Second canonical writer FORBIDDEN.

## C — Projection

SESSION → stub / history / notification only. Reverse FORBIDDEN.

## D — Presentation

DB STATUS ≠ TERMINAL REASON ≠ DISPLAY LABEL. Consume canonical reasons only.  
ONE call moment → ONE primary presentation owner (platform Cap rules in presentation docs).

